profession=Druid
speaker=Rowan Mossweald
hub=A little patience makes a very good gardener.
quest.title=A Garden of Quiet Wonders
quest.description=Build Rowan a conservatory to cultivate plants for alchemy.
quest.objective.token=Collect the conservatory plot token from Rowan.
quest.objective.build=Build the conservatory.
quest.objective.talk=Return to Rowan.
bye=See you later.
how=Tell me about your work.
offer=Would you like to tend a conservatory here?
finish=The conservatory is ready.
progress=About your conservatory...
accept=Let us build it.
later=Perhaps later.
offer.body=There is more to a garden than supper. Give me a conservatory and I will grow plants for potions in Spirit Planters. We will use the same seeds you find out in the world.
accepted.body=Here is my conservatory plan. Keep the way to the storage cupboard clear so I can carry each harvest home.
cancel=I need to put this project aside.
building.body=I will keep my things packed until the conservatory is ready. The plot plan lists the materials we need.
cancelled.body=All right. Find me when you are ready to begin again.
back=Understood.
welcome.body=A lovely place to put down roots. Take these two Spirit Planters. Place them anywhere in town, use one and give it a seed you carry. I will plant it, grow it with my rite and bring the harvest home.
how.body=I grow Health, Stamina and Mana plants in Spirit Planters. Give a planter one seed and its plant grows back after every harvest. My rite grows it one stage at a time, and each harvest brings plants and petals to the conservatory stores. Train my Mastery for stronger plants, and bring Life Essence and plants to improve the garden.
gift.confirm=You brought something for me? Let me see.
gift_love=What a thoughtful gift. I have just the place for this.
gift_like=Oh, this will be useful. Thank you.
gift_neutral=Thank you for thinking of me.
gift_dislike=I appreciate the thought, though this is not quite my sort of thing.
building.name=Conservatory
