greeting.0=A little patience makes a very good gardener.
greeting.1=The planters are quiet today. Come, tell me what you need.
greeting.2=Blood rose, azure fern, storm thistle. Each has its own rhythm.
gift_love_birthday=You remembered my birthday! What a thoughtful gift. I have just the place for this.
