gift_dislike_birthday=You remembered my birthday! I appreciate the thought, though this is not quite my sort of thing.

reward.25=Good tools make gentle hands. I have shared my tool roll plans with the town. A practiced blacksmith can make one for your gardeners.
reward.75=These notes describe how to concentrate the life in three kinds of alchemical plants into a Verdant Catalyst. Your alchemist can teach a skilled brewer to prepare it. The town now knows the recipe.
